referenceFunction.generalComment:
Inventory refers to the distribution of 1 kg of rape methyl ester (RME) in Switzerland. RME is imported from the European Union (EU) and produced from rape oil. Distribution to the final consumer (service station) including all necessary transports.;
CAS number: 073891-99-3; 
Formula: C19H35O2; 
Synonyms: RME, biodiesel, bio-diesel; 
UUID: 66e91feb-6878-3c46-a85a-3d340b24405b
